			"notes": "AI Companion 2.0 — Release 1.0.0\nAdds an AI-powered companion to your Minecraft world, backed by a custom Minecraft-trained model.\nCommands:\n\n/ai spawn — Spawns a companion that follows you\n/ai kill — Removes all companions\n/ai question — Ask a question via chat (API key required, see next step)\nNEW:\n/ai delete-key - Deletes your existing key\n\nRight-click the companion to open an in-game chat GUI with persistent conversation history. Requires a personal API key from [ai.cametendo.org](https://ai.cametendo.org/) — entered once and saved locally.\nRequires Fabric API for Minecraft 1.20.1.\n\nAdded a small easter egg (Hint: Linux User see it every day)"
		},
